  <data name="Label1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Simon is a pattern repetition game. The computer gives you a pattern one item at a time, which you have to repeat. 

1. Select a difficulty level
2. The game will start once you click green and it will give you a sequence
3. After the sequence is given to you, repeat the sequence by clicking the buttons in the correct order
4. If you get it correct, the game will give you a point and the same sequence plus one item
5. Continue to repeat the sequence after it’s given 
6. Once you fail, the game will show your score. 

Easy: 3 buttons, slower speed
Medium: 4 buttons, normal speed (Classic Version)
Hard: 5 buttons, faster speed

the score needed for the leaderboard is 10 for all modes, good luck.</value>
